#. Tag: title
#: man-ring-kde.1.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ring-kde.1.docbook:45
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "SFLphone is meant to be a robust enterprise-class desktop phone. It "
#| "provides functions like call transfer, call hold, multiple lines, "
#| "multiple accounts support. SFLphone audio layer is built upon a native "
#| "ALSA interface and a native PulseAudio interface. sflphone-client-kde is "
#| "a KDE client for SFLphone; it communicates with the core side through D-"
#| "Bus."
msgid ""
"Ring is meant to be a robust enterprise-class desktop phone. It provides "
"functions like call transfer, call hold, multiple lines, multiple accounts "
"support. Ring audio layer is built upon a native ALSA interface and a native "
"PulseAudio interface. ring-kde is a client for Ring built with KDE "
"Frameworks; it communicates with the core side through D-Bus."
msgstr ""
"SFLphone je trebao da bude desktop telefon za korporacije. Omogućava opcije "
"kao što su prebacivanje, poziv na čekanju, višestruke linije, višetruke "
"račune. SFLphone audio okvir je rađen na ALSA okruženju i osnovnom "
"PulseAudio okruženju.  sflphone-client-kde je KDE klijent za SFLphone; on "
"komunicia sa jezgrom preko D-sabirnice."

